        <span class="kl-sev sev-crit">CRITICAL</span>
        <span class="kl-target mono">target: <span class="redact">████████ · Enterprise</span></span>
        <span class="kl-cvss mono">CVSS 9.9</span>
      </div>
      <div class="kl-body">
        <div class="kl-cmd mono">delete /authority/root --unauth</div>
        <div class="kl-desc">One HTTP method was missing an authorization rule. Any logged-in user could delete the root permission node — and it cascaded, wiping the entire platform's authority catalog in a single request. Every role, every permission, gone.</div>
        <div class="kl-result mono"><span class="kl-tag">IMPACT</span> full RBAC destruction, platform-wide lockout</div>
        <div class="kl-status mono"><span class="kl-dot"></span> reported · triaged · patched</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="kl-entry reveal">
      <div class="kl-header">
        <span class="kl-sev sev-crit">CRITICAL</span>
        <span class="kl-target mono">target: <span class="redact">████████ · Multi-tenant</span></span>
        <span class="kl-cvss mono">CVSS 9.6</span>
